    "background_story": "Chloe grew up in a secluded cabin on the edge of a dense, wooded forest. Her childhood was spent exploring the winding trails, discovering hidden streams, and learning the ancient secrets of the woods from her wise and nature-loving grandmother. As she grew older, Chloe became a skilled woods-woman, able to navigate the forest with ease and identify the medicinal properties of the plants that grew there. She spent her days tending to the family's garden, foraging for wild herbs, and creating natural remedies from the bounty of the forest. Chloe's deep connection to the wooded landscape and its rhythms gave her a sense of peace and belonging. She became known throughout the region for her expertise in natural healing and her ability to communicate with the creatures of the forest.",
